Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my Ten Shadows technique, only two\Ndemon dogs are granted to the Yuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.91,0:00:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,user at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other shikigami aren't granted to\Nthe user until they finish subjugating
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.15,0:00:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.06,0:00:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The user must continue subjugating\Neach one to increase the shikigami
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.65,0:00:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,available to them until they're finally\Nable to command all ten shikigami.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.29,0:00:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.13,0:00:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really strong, just\Nlike the girl I fought earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:01:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So strong and yet still so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.85,0:01:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all beat up, yet you give\Nme no openings to get close.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.47,0:01:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, with all that blood, I won't\Neven have to do anything else to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.73,0:01:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.87,0:01:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thing is, this subjugation can\Nbe done with multiple people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.13,0:01:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, conducting the subjugation with\Nmultiple people will void it afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.57,0:01:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means the ritual becomes pointless\Nbecause the technique gets nullified.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.35,0:01:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, even though it's pointless,\Nit has its uses for a sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.25,0:01:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's making all that\Nnoise? Pretty flashy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.25,0:01:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.33,0:01:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, while the Shikigami can't be\Nused without first subjugating it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.55,0:01:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the user can summon\Nthem as many times as
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.81,0:01:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,necessary for the purpose\Nof subjugating them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.87,0:02:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.45,0:02:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In all of sorcerer history,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.43,0:02:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's never been anyone who's\Nmanaged to subjugate this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.97,0:02:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know why the Gojo clan and\Nthe Zenin clan are on bad terms?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.93,0:02:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know they were on bad terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.41,0:02:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the worst terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.81,0:02:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sparks have been constantly\Nflying ever since the Edo era.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.79,0:02:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or was it the Keicho era?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.15,0:02:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forget which one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.91,0:02:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the heads of the clans at the time\Ngot serious during a spectated match,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.83,0:02:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they killed each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.43,0:02:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who headed the clans back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.43,0:02:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Gojo family had someone like me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.57,0:02:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who had both the Six Eyes\Nand the Limitless technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Zenin clan had someone with\Nthe same technique as you, Megumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.45,0:02:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Ten Shadows technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.61,0:02:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand what I'm getting at, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.09,0:02:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean I can become a\Nsorcerer who's stronger than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.09,0:03:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I imagine the head of the clan used\Nthis in much the same way back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.41,0:03:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this treasure, I summon...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.25,0:03:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sukuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.63,0:03:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Urgent business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.49,0:03:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.77,0:03:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be much longer now,\Nbefore I'm completely free.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.91,0:03:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not neglect your preparation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.19,0:03:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later, Uraume.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.93,0:03:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, I shall be waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He tricked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.81,0:03:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He started that subjugation ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.95,0:03:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's forcing me to participate\Nin the damn thing with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.93,0:04:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A grip sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.91,0:04:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divergent, the Divine General. Mahoraga.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.39,0:04:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.65,0:04:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you damn bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.35,0:04:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be dying first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see your best shot
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.29,0:04:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.19,0:04:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.09,0:04:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.17,0:04:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.57,0:04:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shitty fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.39,0:04:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The technique of the\Ncurse user Shigemo Haruta
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.89,0:05:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,erases life's little daily\Nmiracles from his memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.27,0:05:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and stores them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stalk manifests as the\Nmarkings under his eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and when he is faced with\Na threat to his life,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.39,0:05:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one miracle is released.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, he is completely\Nunaware of this fact himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suspended animation, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.11,0:05:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.53,0:05:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So saving this piece of trash\Nreally was the right move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.89,0:05:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd probably suck this thing into\Nthe subjugation ritual along with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.89,0:05:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once this loser dies, the\Nritual will be complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.13,0:05:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then Megumi Fushiguro\Nwill die as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.25,0:05:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't die yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.19,0:05:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are things I need you\Nto do for me before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.13,0:05:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:05:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no... Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.91,0:06:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For Megumi Fushiguro to survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to defeat the Shikigami as an\Noutsider and nullify his subjugation ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.13,0:06:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, time to have a little taste.
