Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.13,0:06:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dismantle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.95,0:07:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.49,0:07:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Sword of Exorcism.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.57,0:07:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A specialized blade to\Ncombat cursed spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's packed with the same positive energy\Ngenerated by a reverse curse technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I was a cursed spirit, that would\Nhave eliminated me with the first blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.53,0:07:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.27,0:08:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.43,0:08:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.43,0:09:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.81,0:09:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.47,0:09:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.63,0:10:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That felt odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.55,0:10:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again, again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.69,0:11:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.93,0:11:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.89,0:11:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you've done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.93,0:12:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can see it, Mahoraga!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.07,0:12:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can see my curse technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.93,0:12:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.93,0:13:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.19,0:14:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're similar to Yamata no Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.07,0:14:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You follow my slices, and\Nattack with cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.45,0:14:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both started happening after that\Ngreat wheel of yours revolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.55,0:14:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The incantation of sacred\Ntreasures and that great
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.69,0:14:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wheel both represent\Nperfect cycles and harmony,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.15,0:14:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which suggests that the Shikigami's ability\Nis to adapt to anything and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.37,0:14:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the ultimate elite throw\Nin rock, paper, scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.87,0:14:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might have had a\Nchance to defeat me if
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.55,0:14:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was still in the state\NI was in back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:15:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you've fascinated\Nme, Megumi Fushiguro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.99,0:15:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Domain Expansion
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.81,0:15:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Malevolent Shrine
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.61,0:15:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sukuna's Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.83,0:15:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Malevolent Shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.55,0:15:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike other domains, it does not cut\Nout a separate space with a barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.49,0:15:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Manifesting an innate domain\Nwithout sealing it in a barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.87,0:15:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is like trying to paint a picture\Nin the air without a canvas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.93,0:15:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a truly divine feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To top it off, by adding a pact to\Nallow its victims a path of escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it vastly increases the\Nrange of its guaranteed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.33,0:15:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hit effect to a maximum\Nof a 200 meter radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.27,0:15:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though out of consideration for\Nits effect on Megumi Fushiguro,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.71,0:16:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he has currently restrained the effect to\Na 140 meter radius limited to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.07,0:16:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything nope no signal\Nsame yeah but I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.37,0:16:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think we need to worry about that anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Remember the guy with the\Nmegaphone? I'm pretty sure he should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.21,0:16:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sukuna's slices are comprised of two types
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.67,0:16:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cleave attacks things\Nwith cursed energy in
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.11,0:16:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the range of his guaranteed hit effect,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.89,0:16:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dismantle attacks things\Nwithout cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.53,0:16:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.65,0:16:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attack all targets relentlessly\Nuntil Malevolent Shrine is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.47,0:16:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only sure way to defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.85,0:16:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mahoraga is to slaughter it with the first\Nuse of an attack before it can adapt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.85,0:16:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Klee would have fulfilled\Nthose conditions,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.81,0:16:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that wouldn't\Nnecessarily hold true if it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.15,0:16:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It had adapted to slices in general,\Nrather than to dismantle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.39,0:17:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maharaga's regeneration\Nwill soon be complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.71,0:17:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.47,0:18:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.05,0:18:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.39,0:18:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.81,0:18:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My luck never runs out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.27,0:18:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you another day!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.17,0:19:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I survived!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.27,0:19:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigemo's stock of miracles had run\Nout in his battle against Kento Nanami.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.67,0:19:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nearly time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fushiguro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.49,0:19:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.40,0:19:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just saw Itadori for a\Nmoment. No. Was it Tsukuna?
