Dialogue: 3,0:19:27.13,0:19:31.50,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an1\blur0.6\fnAribau Grotesk\fs71\fscx96\c&H000000&\pos(430.4,1020.4)\b1}Dogenzaka, In Front of Shibuya 109
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.19,0:19:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.87,0:19:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be sure to savor this feeling forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.21,0:20:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.73,0:20:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.01,0:20:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.63,0:20:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.85,0:20:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.29,0:21:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.41,0:21:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.99,0:21:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.97,0:21:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.19,0:21:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.63,0:21:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.41,0:21:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not be able to give you a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.31,0:21:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I was over me, I will be able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.41,0:21:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should make you cry.\NYou're a rendezvous?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.59,0:21:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may get so much. You are my special.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.21,0:21:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to go, I have to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.03,0:21:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should make you cry.\NYou're a rendezvous?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.11,0:21:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I'll just be a murderer.
